    "p5.rec.3": "<b>Treat debt-to-income above 60% as a confirmed, broad underwriting signal</b> — it held up across every segment checked against it.",
    "p5.rec.4": "<b>Route the \"high interest rate + denial/thin serviceability\" flagged applications to underwriting</b> for manual pattern review; this is the most business-relevant anomaly category found.",
