    "p5.rec.6": "<b>Report K-Means segments as an applied business grouping, not a discovered natural structure</b> — pair any segment-level claim with the DBSCAN continuum finding (only 0.6% isolated) so stakeholders don't over-read the 4 segments as real population boundaries.",
    "p5.rec.src.finding1": "→ Finding #1", "p5.rec.src.finding2": "→ Finding #2", "p5.rec.src.finding3": "→ Finding #3", "p5.rec.src.finding4": "→ Finding #4",
